<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/24/eng@/~cl_13> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/24/eng@/~cl_13> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 14 the following section: “Filing in of application 14. Notwithstanding the provisions of any written law on the territorial jurisdiction of a court, an application for a protection order or an interim protection order involving a complaint of domestic violence may be filed in any district where— (a) the complainant resides; (b) the person against whom the protection is sought resides;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/24/eng@> .
